Package: com.huhansibuxin.disablebgkeepalive
Name: DisableBgKeepalive
Depends: mobilesubstrate, ellekit
Version: 1.1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: 禁用后台保活 (Disable Background Keepalive). Hooks every iOS runtime
 channel that an app uses to stay alive in the background: beginBackgroundTask*,
 legacy VoIP setKeepAliveTimeout:, BGTaskScheduler, PKPushRegistry/VoIP,
 CLLocationManager, background fetch, CBCentralManager/CBPeripheralManager
 restore, NSURLSession background, HKHealthStore delivery, and silent push
 application:didReceiveRemoteNotification:fetchCompletionHandler:. All are
 refused/short-circuited whenever the app is not in the foreground, so the
 system suspends it immediately after leaving. For static UIBackgroundModes,
 run the bundled strip_bg_modes.sh against the target bundle id.
Maintainer: huhansibuxin
Author: huhansibuxin
Section: Tweaks
